# Build context is packages/the-storm; keep local build output and caches out.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
# Baked rwf navigation meshes reach the image from the asset bucket (the fetch stage reads
# rwf/nav-manifest.json), never from whatever a checkout happens to have fetched.
**/nav.rwfnav
**/nav.rwfnav.*.partial
